    "title": "SSM Health Good Samaritan Hospital Celebrates Record-Breaking Year for the Women's Center - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Withers Syndication ,\n6 hours ago Mt. Vernon, IL (March 18, 2026) – The Women’s Center at SSM Health Good Samaritan Hospital is celebrating another historic milestone after welcoming 1,629 babies in 2025, marking the highest annual number of births in the health ministry’s history. This record-breaking year reflects the continued trust families place in the Women’s Center team and the hospital’s ongoing commitment to providing high-quality, compassionate maternity care at every stage of pregnancy, delivery, and recovery. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
